WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Two homes with similar prices can still

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.420
fit your monthly budget differently.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.900
The price alone isn't the whole comparison.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.040
Taxes, insurance, association dues and utilities all

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.660
belong in the spending picture.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.380
Maintenance and repair needs matter, too.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.860
Use estimates for the homes you're considering.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.560
Keep unknown amounts visible instead of filling

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.620
them in with zero.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.400
Then look at what you want from

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.380
the home and what makes you hesitate.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.700
A repair concern needs an answer.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.480
The home comparison worksheet keeps those questions

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.320
together. Review your answers before sending them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.040
to me, or print the comparison for

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.010
yourself.
